Here's a JavaScript function that accepts text and posts a message via the Slack API to the specified channel:

```javascript
function postToSlack(text, channel) {
  const webhookUrl = `https://hooks.slack.com/services/${channel}/${process.env.SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET}`;
  const payload = {
    text: text
  };
  fetch(webhookUrl, {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
      'Content-Type': 'application/json'
    },
    body: JSON.stringify(payload)
  });
}
```

Make sure to replace `process.env.SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET` with your actual Slack signing secret.

