Here's your custom PHP function "smart_sort_array":
```php
function smart_sort_array($set, $order) {
    // Sort the set by age in ascending order (default) or descending order based on $order parameter
    usort($set, function ($a, $b) use ($order) {
        return $order === 'asc' ? strcmp($a['age'], $b['age']) : strcmp($b['age'], $a['age']);
    });
    return $set;
}
```
