}

.sun.night {
    background-image: url("night_sun.png");
}
```
This CSS code defines two classes: `.sun` and `.sun.day`, which are used to style the sun image. The `.sun` class is applied by default, while the `.sun.day` class is applied during the day and the `.sun.night` class is applied during the night.

